{
    "title": "Pizza Maker Kids Cooking Games",
    "description": "\ud83c\udf55 Let's Start The Pizza Addiction! \ud83c\udf55\r\n\r\nGet ready for a slice of fun with our super-duper Pizza Maker Kids Cooking Games! This user friendly game is perfect for your toddler, preschool champs, and emerging kindergarten clever cookies who love to play and cook.\r\n\r\nIn this pizza game by Piggy Panda, you'll learn how to make the most delicious pan pizzas ever. Now, it's super easy to become a baker of yummy pizzas!\r\n\r\n\r\nWhat to find:\r\n* Versatile categories: Italian, Christmas, Vampire pizza, Pirate Pizza, Kawaii Pizza, Mix Pizza, and some side fun mini games.\r\n* Enjoy combining tasty toppings in the Mix Pizza category.\r\n* Distinct toppings, a unique stack of sauces for each category, & table decorations to present yourself as an apt baker.\r\n\r\nWhat you'll do:\r\n* Dough Making: Make your dough from scratch by mixing ingredients to give it a texture like the bread.\r\n* Dough Shape: Choose your dough from different shapes and stretch it through rolling.\r\n* Chop ingredients with a knife, shred the cheese, and whip the sauce in the blender for the self crafted recipes on the menu.\r\n* Add Toppings: Cheese, pepperoni, olive, tomato, corn, ham stripes, onion, chicken chunks, pineapple, sausage, shrimp, and much more to make your favorites.\r\n* Baking: Push the pizza into the grill oven and bake to reach perfect crispness with a healthy steam.\r\n* Slice and bite your wonderful meal!\r\n\r\nWhy you'll love it:\r\n* Simple controls to make it easily playable.\r\n* Explore a whole world of delicious toppings to enhance your pizza\u2019s aesthetic appeal.\r\n* Kids will love creating their own pizzas, and adults will have fun playing along.\r\n* Learn about different pizza ingredients and the process to bring out your best chef personality.\r\n* No messy kitchen! Get all the pizza parlor fun without the flour mess.\r\n\r\nDon't forget to share your creations with your friends! Show them your amazing pizza-making skills!\r\n\r\nGet cooking today! \ud83c\udf55\ud83c\udf89\r\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\nVisit our page for more toddler games and we eagerly await your feedback: \r\n\r\nHelp & Support: feedback@thepiggypanda.com   \r\nPrivacy policy: http://thepiggypanda.com/privacy-policy.html  \r\nChildren\u2019s Policy: http://thepiggypanda.com/children-data-policy.html  \r\nTerms of Use: https://thepiggypanda.com/terms-of-use.html",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83c\udf55 Let&#39;s Start The Pizza Addiction! \ud83c\udf55<br><br>Get ready for a slice of fun with our super-duper Pizza Maker Kids Cooking Games! This user friendly game is perfect for your toddler, preschool champs, and emerging kindergarten clever cookies who love to play and cook.<br><br>In this pizza game by Piggy Panda, you&#39;ll learn how to make the most delicious pan pizzas ever. Now, it&#39;s super easy to become a baker of yummy pizzas!<br><br><br>What to find:<br>* Versatile categories: Italian, Christmas, Vampire pizza, Pirate Pizza, Kawaii Pizza, Mix Pizza, and some side fun mini games.<br>* Enjoy combining tasty toppings in the Mix Pizza category.<br>* Distinct toppings, a unique stack of sauces for each category, &amp; table decorations to present yourself as an apt baker.<br><br>What you&#39;ll do:<br>* Dough Making: Make your dough from scratch by mixing ingredients to give it a texture like the bread.<br>* Dough Shape: Choose your dough from different shapes and stretch it through rolling.<br>* Chop ingredients with a knife, shred the cheese, and whip the sauce in the blender for the self crafted recipes on the menu.<br>* Add Toppings: Cheese, pepperoni, olive, tomato, corn, ham stripes, onion, chicken chunks, pineapple, sausage, shrimp, and much more to make your favorites.<br>* Baking: Push the pizza into the grill oven and bake to reach perfect crispness with a healthy steam.<br>* Slice and bite your wonderful meal!<br><br>Why you&#39;ll love it:<br>* Simple controls to make it easily playable.<br>* Explore a whole world of delicious toppings to enhance your pizza\u2019s aesthetic appeal.<br>* Kids will love creating their own pizzas, and adults will have fun playing along.<br>* Learn about different pizza ingredients and the process to bring out your best chef personality.<br>* No messy kitchen! Get all the pizza parlor fun without the flour mess.<br><br>Don&#39;t forget to share your creations with your friends! Show them your amazing pizza-making skills!<br><br>Get cooking today! \ud83c\udf55\ud83c\udf89<br>-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br><br>Visit our page for more toddler games and we eagerly await your feedback: <br><br>Help &amp; Support: feedback@thepiggypanda.com   <br>Privacy policy: http://thepiggypanda.com/privacy-policy.html  <br>Children\u2019s Policy: http://thepiggypanda.com/children-data-policy.html  <br>Terms of Use: https://thepiggypanda.com/terms-of-use.html",
